{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">尊敬的客户：</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">您好！</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">十一国庆假期来临，预计全国多地高速公路、城市道路将出现交通拥堵情况，您的快件可能延误到达和交付，我们将全力调配资源保障快递及时准确送达，以最大程度降低突发情况对快件服务的影响。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">如需咨询任何物流问题，可通过商家工作台或京东快递小程序联系在线客服，也可以拨打客服热线950616或联系您的专属客户经理进行咨询。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">2024-09-27</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02289", "contentTitle": "十一国庆假期快递时效的温馨提醒", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1727403080000, "id": 4982, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1727403217342.jpg", "updateTime": 1727403327000}}